61
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:35,850
Rigazzo!

62
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:38,777
You haven't seen an injured
guy around here, have you?

63
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:41,080
He's pretty tall and has black hair.

64
00:04:43,180 --> 00:04:45,800
