did with the fingers and I.

257
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:24,917
Bucciarati's hiding in someone.

258
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:27,317
He's wearing one of them like a costume.

259
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:30,224
And now he's going to
head deeper into the city.

260
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:32,960
I should probably go grab my bro.

261
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,350
Damn it.

262
00:15:34,433 --> 00:15:38,017
They're scattering in all directions,
and there's not a zipper in sight.

263
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:39,000
Who is it?

264
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:40,740
Who is he hiding in?

265
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:00,950
Jeez!

266
00:16:01,033 --> 00:16:02,372
Buss off, you pesky fly!

267
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:18,940
It's a tooth!

268
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:21,177
I used Golden Wind to
imbue your broken tooth

269
00:16:21,260 --> 00:16:23,857
with life and turned it
into a common housefly.

270
00:16:23,940 --> 00:16:28,175
The fly was compelled to return to
you, rendering your disguise useless.

271
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:29,490
Wonderful.

272
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,797
So much for saying I wouldn't
involve ordinary citizens.

273
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:35,657
Sorry, didn't mean to be a liar.

274
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:36,570
Then again,

275
00:16:36,653 --> 00:16:39,737
you didn't suffer any more pain
than what you inflicted on that fly,

276
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:42,580
so it all evens out in
the end. Hang in there.

277
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:46,580
Giorno Giovanna, you've done very well.

278
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:49,417
It's clear that your
abilities demand respect.

279
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:50,600
I've no choice.

280
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:52,862
I shall face this fight head on.

281
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:56,860
Fool, you forced me to
eliminate you where you stand.

282
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:03,840
I refuse to let you get away.

283
00:17:04,540 --> 00:17:07,660
I'll fight with my life to
keep you here. Oh, please.

284
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:10,217
I wouldn't concern myself with that.

285
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:12,220
I think if I were in your shoes,

286
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:14,457
I'd worry about what would happen?

287
00:17:14,540 --> 00:17:17,637
after being zipped apart and
strewn across the ground.

288
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:21,485
Whichever one of us lands the
first blow will end up the victor.

289
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,440
Is something wrong?

290
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:26,360
Vieni, vieni, Giorno Giovanna!

291
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:39,260
Now say goodbye to your senses.

292
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,180
You're thinking why?

293
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,800
I struck him first.

294
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:58,217
I suppose it's only natural that'd
be running through your mind.

295
00:17:58,300 --> 00:18:00,860
You lost because it's not my arm.

296
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:03,457
Fortunately, with my
stand's special ability,

297
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:06,775
I can conjoin objects to
virtually any part of my body.

298
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:09,909
So you know, this arm
belongs to that goon.

299
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,532
I made a quick exchange.

300
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:13,717
Given your stand's abilities,

301
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:17,497
I'm sure you can understand my wanting
to give myself some extra protection.

302
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:19,286
You can never be too careful.

303
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:22,680
Do you see now?

304
00:18:22,820 --> 00:18:25,938
That's why your golden wind
was rendered ineffective.

305
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:36,540
It's too late now just give up
already this is the end for you.

306
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:45,677
Incredible he actually
tore off his own arm to

307
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:48,177
lengthen his range and
strike just a moment faster.

308
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:49,757
Golden wind do

309
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:55,257
it damn not again

310
00:18:55,340 --> 00:18:59,100
he's forced my mind into
hyperdrive. Shit! I'm finished!

311
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:03,057
The destructive power of Giorno
Giovanna's stand may be negligible,

312
00:19:03,140 --> 00:19:05,728
but that just makes
things much, much worse!

313
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:14,420
I've done it once, but to endure that
pain in slow motion over and over...

314
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:16,820
There's no question!

315
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:18,472
I'll die from the shock!

316
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:22,910
Don't...

317
00:19:22,993 --> 00:19:23,823
Stop!

318
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,165
Why did you step out of range?

319
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:37,600
Wait, Giorno.

320
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:39,060
Explain yourself.

321
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:40,460
You had me.

322
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:41,820
Why did you stop?

323
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:43,493
Why didn't you kill me?

324
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:48,460
It's because you have a good soul.

325
00:19:49,760 --> 00:19:52,054
You're in the Mafia, but you're decent.

326
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:55,680
Earlier, you went to attack
me, but hesitated a bit.

327
00:19:56,260 --> 00:19:59,201
That's when I realized I
needed to stop my attack.

328
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:02,177
When you looked over at the
arm you stole from this kid,

329
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:04,957
the abnormal marks on his
skin caught you off guard,

330
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:07,275
which made you freeze up for a moment.

331
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:11,542
You didn't expect to see the arm
of an addict, and it shocked you.

332
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,660
I wonder how old he is.

333
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,310
Just 13.

334
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:21,300
Thing is, an ordinary mafiosa
wouldn't have been impeded.

335
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:25,638
If you were that type, I'd already
be ground into these stones by now.

336
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:28,037
You're different from the other goons.

337
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:31,296
Once I saw that, I didn't
see the need in us fighting.

338
00:20:32,580 --> 00:20:35,277
Some here will even stoop
to selling drugs to kids.

339
00:20:35,360 --> 00:20:36,457
Totally unforgivable.

340
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:37,370
Right?

341
00:20:37,453 --> 00:20:38,948
I know that's how you feel.

342
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:44,160
But you've got a real big problem,
because your boss is the peddler.

343
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:46,753
The truth has you split down the middle.

344
00:20:47,340 --> 00:20:49,417
That's why the side of the arm pains you.

345
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:51,147
You have a chivalrous heart.

346
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:54,097
What does my heart have
to do with anything?

347
00:20:54,180 --> 00:20:56,777
Chivalrous or otherwise,
I still have to kill you.

348
00:20:56,860 --> 00:20:58,897
My mission is to find
the person who took down

349
00:20:58,980 --> 00:21:01,957
Luca and execute him like
the treacherous dog he is.

350
00:21:02,040 --> 00:21:04,877
You didn't have the stomach
to go through with killing me.

351
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:08,640
But don't expect me to show
that detestable weakness! No.

352
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:12,814
Trust me, you just don't have
it in you to take my life.

353
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:13,990
Come again?

354
00:21:14,180 --> 00:21:15,239
You won't kill me.

355
00:21:15,380 --> 00:21:16,320
I'm sure of it.

356
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:17,981
How do you know?

357
00:21:19,340 --> 00:21:22,399
Because you're going to be
joining me on my mission.

358
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:28,780
You see, I'm planning to beat your boss
and take back this city for the people.

359
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:30,430
What?

360
00:21:30,860 --> 00:21:34,331
To rid this city of drug dealing
and child abusing mafiosi,

361
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:37,696
I have no other choice but
to become a mafioso myself.

362
00:21:38,120 --> 00:21:39,708
What are you trying to say?

363
00:21:39,860 --> 00:21:42,857
Surely your mission doesn't
involve joining our syndicate.

364
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:43,860
It's absurd.

365
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,157
Do you have any idea what you're saying?

366
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,358
Isn't it beautiful?

367
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:49,177
What something like that would entail?

368
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:50,740
Yeah, it's risky.

369
00:21:50,940 --> 00:21:52,337
But to take back the city,

370
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:56,714
I have to join the syndicate that
controls it and work my way to the top.

371
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,577
Bucciarati, trust me.

372
00:21:59,660 --> 00:22:01,200
I'll be a primo mafioso.

373
00:22:17,980 --> 00:22:19,777
Get you out of my mind.

374
00:22:19,860 --> 00:22:23,257
Since you'll be all I see.

375
00:22:23,340 --> 00:22:26,357
I would give anything.

376
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:30,397
Just to make you understand me.

377
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:34,737
I don't give a damn about nothing else.

378
00:22:34,820 --> 00:22:38,297
The freaky you is all I need.

379
00:22:38,380 --> 00:22:41,217
I need your body.

380
00:22:41,300 --> 00:22:43,457
I need your body.

381
00:22:43,540 --> 00:22:49,877
Yeah, whatever you want.

382
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:53,797
I'll give it to you, baby.

383
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:57,637
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

384
00:22:57,720 --> 00:23:02,757
You got my mind.

385
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:06,897
You got my mind, I don't
want to do it for you.

386
00:23:06,980 --> 00:23:09,337
What must I say?

387
00:23:09,420 --> 00:23:12,617
What must I do?

388
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:14,580
What must I do?

389
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:16,800
To show how much

390
00:23:17,840 --> 00:23:20,320
I'm gonna freak you?

391
00:23:21,380 --> 00:23:24,980
What must I sell you?

392
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:27,200
What must I do?

393
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:34,520
To show how much I'm gonna freak you?

394
00:23:42,700 --> 00:23:43,530
Thank you.

395
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,680
Thank you.
